{"id":"3f5a5d2316370c0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Set Rank","display":"df-zfc-set9-set-rank — ZFC Set9 Set Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-set-rank — ZFC Set9 Set Rank","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-set-rank — ZFC Set9 Set Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b50de0d408d2a30\" href=\"?note=8b50de0d408d2a30\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(x,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (rank-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b50de0d408d2a30\" href=\"?note=8b50de0d408d2a30\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (set-rank relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}set\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S(x,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D,\\rho\\in V\\;\\bigl(D=\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S(\\rho,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in D\\times D:u\\in v\\},D)\\land\\alpha=\\rho(x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}set\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S(x,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D,\\rho\\in V\\;\\bigl(D=\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S(\\rho,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in D\\times D:u\\in v\\},D)\\land\\alpha=\\rho(x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recursion is restricted to the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\)</span>, avoiding existential quantification over a global proper-class rank graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b50de0d408d2a30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V$ (transitive-closure operator, see [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b50de0d408d2a30","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (rank-function predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}set\\text{-}rank} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S(x,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D,\\rho\\in V\\;\\bigl(D=\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S(\\rho,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in D\\times D:u\\in v\\},D)\\land\\alpha=\\rho(x)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})","display":false}],"bytes":1144,"backlinks":[{"id":"22f0af31d974b262","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S$ 使用 [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md]] 的集合秩关系。"}